# Local Mistral notes (DO NOT COMMIT REAL KEYS)

Copy to `secrets/mistr.local.md` and fill privately. That file is gitignored.

```bash
cp secrets/mistr.local.md.example secrets/mistr.local.md
```

## Private checklist

- Key created at: console.mistral.ai (date: ____)
- Key name / last4: ____
- Stored in: `.env.local` only (never git, never Discord)
- Large (`mistral-large-latest`): works? Y/N
- Codestral (`codestral-latest`): works? Y/N
- `/api/ai-status` mistralKeyPresent: Y/N

## Paste zone (local only)

```text
MISTRAL_API_KEY=
```

Delete this file before sharing the machine / zip archive.
